message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below.
  The accompanying manuscript has no verified public venue, DOI, or
  publication date; it is cited here as an uploaded manuscript.
type: software
title: "vinemis-vineyard-decision-support: synthetic geotagged plant-passport demo"
abstract: >-
  A standard-library-only Python demo that builds a synthetic vineyard
  plant-passport registry (RFID-style 14-digit eIDs fused with
  deterministic WGS84 coordinates), persists it to JSON or SQLite,
  exports GeoJSON and KML, and produces a decision-support summary.
authors:
